    },
    {
      "id": "twelfth-night-or-what-you-will/sceneIII_36.2/p@90653",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "FABIAN.\nThis is a dear manikin to you, Sir Toby.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "twelfth-night-or-what-you-will/sceneIII_36.2/p@90653/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 7,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "twelfth-night-or-what-you-will/sceneIII_36.2/p@90653/line-2",
          "start": 8,
          "end": 48,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 6411333,
        "end": 6411411,
        "line": 239708,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap36/p@90653",
        "anchor": "sceneIII_36.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "FABIAN.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "twelfth-night-or-what-you-will/sceneIII_36.2/p@90735",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "SIR TOBY.\nI have been dear to him, lad, some two thousand strong, or so.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "twelfth-night-or-what-you-will/sceneIII_36.2/p@90735/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 9,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "twelfth-night-or-what-you-will/sceneIII_36.2/p@90735/line-2",
          "start": 10,
          "end": 72,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 6411415,
        "end": 6411517,
        "line": 239713,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap36/p@90735",
        "anchor": "sceneIII_36.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "SIR TOBY.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "twelfth-night-or-what-you-will/sceneIII_36.2/p@90841",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "FABIAN.\nWe shall have a rare letter from him; but you’ll not deliver it.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "twelfth-night-or-what-you-will/sceneIII_36.2/p@90841/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 7,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "twelfth-night-or-what-you-will/sceneIII_36.2/p@90841/line-2",
          "start": 8,
          "end": 72,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 6411521,
        "end": 6411623,
        "line": 239718,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap36/p@90841",
        "anchor": "sceneIII_36.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "FABIAN.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "twelfth-night-or-what-you-will/sceneIII_36.2/p@90947",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "SIR TOBY.\nNever trust me then. And by all means stir on the youth to an answer. I think oxen and wainropes cannot hale them together. For Andrew, if he were opened and you find so much blood in his liver as will clog the foot of a flea, I’ll eat the rest of th’ anatomy.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "twelfth-night-or-what-you-will/sceneIII_36.2/p@90947/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 9,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "twelfth-night-or-what-you-will/sceneIII_36.2/p@90947/line-2",
          "start": 10,
          "end": 270,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 6411627,
        "end": 6411930,
        "line": 239723,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap36/p@90947",
        "anchor": "sceneIII_36.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "SIR TOBY.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "twelfth-night-or-what-you-will/sceneIII_36.2/p@91254",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "FABIAN.\nAnd his opposite, the youth, bears in his visage no great presage of cruelty.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "twelfth-night-or-what-you-will/sceneIII_36.2/p@91254/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 7,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "twelfth-night-or-what-you-will/sceneIII_36.2/p@91254/line-2",
          "start": 8,
          "end": 85,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 6411934,
        "end": 6412049,
        "line": 239731,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap36/p@91254",
        "anchor": "sceneIII_36.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "FABIAN.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "twelfth-night-or-what-you-will/sceneIII_36.2/p@91373",
      "type": "stage",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "scenedesc"
      ],
      "text": "Enter Maria.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [
        {
          "tag": "span",
          "start": 6,
          "end": 11,
          "className": "charname"
        }
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "twelfth-night-or-what-you-will/sceneIII_36.2/p@91373/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 12,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 6412053,
        "end": 6412124,
        "line": 239736,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap36/p@91373",
        "anchor": "sceneIII_36.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": null,
      "attribution": {
        "status": "not-applicable"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "twelfth-night-or-what-you-will/sceneIII_36.2/p@91448",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "SIR TOBY.\nLook where the youngest wren of nine comes.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "twelfth-night-or-what-you-will/sceneIII_36.2/p@91448/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 9,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "twelfth-night-or-what-you-will/sceneIII_36.2/p@91448/line-2",
          "start": 10,
          "end": 53,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 6412128,
        "end": 6412211,
        "line": 239740,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap36/p@91448",
        "anchor": "sceneIII_36.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "SIR TOBY.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "twelfth-night-or-what-you-will/sceneIII_36.2/p@91535",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "MARIA.\nIf you desire the spleen, and will laugh yourselves into stitches, follow me. Yond gull Malvolio is turned heathen, a very renegado; for there is no Christian that means to be saved by believing rightly can ever believe such impossible passages of grossness. He’s in yellow stockings.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "twelfth-night-or-what-you-will/sceneIII_36.2/p@91535/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 6,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "twelfth-night-or-what-you-will/sceneIII_36.2/p@91535/line-2",
          "start": 7,
          "end": 291,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 6412215,
        "end": 6412539,
        "line": 239745,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap36/p@91535",
        "anchor": "sceneIII_36.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "MARIA.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 6
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "twelfth-night-or-what-you-will/sceneIII_36.2/p@91863",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "SIR TOBY.\nAnd cross-gartered?",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "twelfth-night-or-what-you-will/sceneIII_36.2/p@91863/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 9,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "twelfth-night-or-what-you-will/sceneIII_36.2/p@91863/line-2",
          "start": 10,
          "end": 29,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 6412543,
        "end": 6412602,
        "line": 239753,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap36/p@91863",
        "anchor": "sceneIII_36.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "SIR TOBY.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "twelfth-night-or-what-you-will/sceneIII_36.2/p@91926",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "MARIA.\nMost villainously; like a pedant that keeps a school i’ th’ church. I have dogged him like his murderer. He does obey every point of the letter that I dropped to betray him. He does smile his face into more lines than is in the new map with the augmentation of the Indies. You have not seen such a thing as ’tis. I  can hardly forbear hurling things at him. I know my lady will strike him. If she do, he’ll smile and take’t for a great favour.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "twelfth-night-or-what-you-will/sceneIII_36.2/p@91926/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 6,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "twelfth-night-or-what-you-will/sceneIII_36.2/p@91926/line-2",
          "start": 7,
          "end": 450,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 6412606,
        "end": 6413091,
        "line": 239758,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap36/p@91926",
        "anchor": "sceneIII_36.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "MARIA.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 6
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "twelfth-night-or-what-you-will/sceneIII_36.2/p@92415",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "SIR TOBY.\nCome, bring us, bring us where he is.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "twelfth-night-or-what-you-will/sceneIII_36.2/p@92415/line-1",
